      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1908813846141190144/PeyzcyMF_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "8/8 Karpathy 展望未来：AI agent 会成为新型数字信息消费者，企业要为它们准备专属文档和 API。AI 让人人都能用自然语言“编程”，但部署和基础设施仍是挑战。#AI #未来软件 https://t.co/HZ9eUWEGFu",
    "created_at": "2025-06-19T03:36:41.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 1,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 1,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 39,
      "impression_count": 39
    },
    "media": [
      {
