  {
    "id": "1935542219391516746",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1908813846141190144/PeyzcyMF_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "7/8 最优的人机协作是“AI 生成-人类验证”模式。通过可视化界面加快验证，避免 AI 输出过多导致难以审核。任务要拆分为小块，保持聚焦，防止“AI 迷路”。",
    "created_at": "2025-06-19T03:36:40.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 1,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 32,
      "impression_count": 32
