  {
    "id": "1935542211397173704",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1908813846141190144/PeyzcyMF_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "5/8 Karpathy 认为 LLM 是“人类精神的随机模拟”，拥有超强知识与记忆力，但也有幻觉、缺乏自知之明、智能分布不均等明显缺陷。用好它们，要懂得扬长避短。#AI #认知 https://t.co/R6pnRTNFfI",
